{
  "id": "437",
  "title": "How Will You Spend Christmas?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-12-15",
  "synopsis": "Ben asks Lili how she will spend Christmas.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/602/1d90ede564474170673dcb6be28552ee70bbeccd.mp3?1554973303",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 2: Lili’s Boyfriend",
    "chapter": 26,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你怎么过圣诞节？\n\n本：丽丽，圣诞节快到了，你怎么过圣诞节？\n丽丽：我和我男朋友一起去吃饭，看电影。\n本：你不和你爸爸妈妈一起过吗？\n丽丽：不和。在中国，我们喜欢和男朋友、女朋友一起过圣诞节，和爸爸妈妈一起过春节。你呢？圣诞节回国吗？\n本：不回。学校圣诞节不放假，新年也只放假一天，回不去。\n丽丽：也是。在中国，要快到春节的时候才能放长假。",
    "traditional": "你怎麼過聖誕節？\n\n本：麗麗，聖誕節快到了，你怎麼過聖誕節？\n麗麗：我和我男朋友一起去吃飯，看電影。\n本：你不和你爸爸媽媽一起過嗎？\n麗麗：不和。在中國，我們喜歡和男朋友、女朋友一起過聖誕節，和爸爸媽媽一起過春節。你呢？聖誕節回國嗎？\n本：不回。學校聖誕節不放假，新年也只放假一天，回不去。\n麗麗：也是。在中國，要快到春節的時候才能放長假。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How Will You Spend Christmas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，圣诞节快到了，你怎么过圣诞节？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，聖誕節快到了，你怎麼過聖誕節？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì shèng dàn jié kuài dào le nǐ zěn me guò shèng dàn jié",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, Christmas is about to arrive. How are you spending Christmas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我和我男朋友一起去吃饭，看电影。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我和我男朋友一起去吃飯，看電影。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ hé wǒ nán péng you yì qǐ qù chī fàn kàn diàn yǐng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I will go for a meal with my boyfriend, and watch a movie."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：你不和你爸爸妈妈一起过吗？",
      "traditional": "本：你不和你爸爸媽媽一起過嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ bù hé nǐ bà ba mā ma yì qǐ guò ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: You don't spend it with your mom and dad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：不和。在中国，我们喜欢和男朋友、女朋友一起过圣诞节，",
      "traditional": "麗麗：不和。在中國，我們喜歡和男朋友、女朋友一起過聖誕節，",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bù hé zài zhōng guó wǒ men xǐ huan hé nán péng you nǚ péng you yì qǐ guò shèng dàn jié",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "和爸爸妈妈一起过春节。",
      "traditional": "和爸爸媽媽一起過春節。",
      "pinyin": "hé bà ba mā ma yì qǐ guò chūn jié",
      "english": "Lili: No. In China, we like to spend Christmas with our boyfriends and girlfriends, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "你呢？圣诞节回国吗？",
      "traditional": "你呢？聖誕節回國嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ ne shèng dàn jié huí guó ma",
      "english": ".. and spend Spring Festival with our moms and dads."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What about you? Are you going back to your country for Christmas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：不回。学校圣诞节不放假，新年也只放假一天，回不去。",
      "traditional": "本：不回。學校聖誕節不放假，新年也只放假一天，回不去。",
      "pinyin": "běn bù huí xué xiào shèng dàn jié bú fàng jià xīn nián yě zhǐ fàng jià yì tiān huí bú qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I'm not. There's no school break for Christmas, and only one day off for New Years, so I can't go back."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：也是。在中国，要快到春节的时候才能放长假。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：也是。在中國，要快到春節的時候才能放長假。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yě shì zài zhōng guó yào kuài dào chūn jié de shí hou cái néng fàng cháng jià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: That's true. In China, we don't have a long holiday until Spring Festival is about to arrive."
    }
  ],
