    "sentence_translations": [
      "How Will You Spend Christmas?",
      "",
      "Ben: Lili, Christmas is about to arrive. How are you spending Christmas?",
      "",
      "Lili: I will go for a meal with my boyfriend, and watch a movie.",
      "",
      "Ben: You don't spend it with your mom and dad?",
      "",
      "Lili: No. In China, we like to spend Christmas with our boyfriends and girlfriends, ..",
      ".. and spend Spring Festival with our moms and dads.",
      "What about you? Are you going back to your country for Christmas?",
      "",
      "Ben: I'm not. There's no school break for Christmas, and only one day off for New Years, so I can't go back.",
      "",
      "Lili: That's true. In China, we don't have a long holiday until Spring Festival is about to arrive.",
      ""
    ]
  }
